<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Oct 3.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Oct 3.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Thursday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- President Ben Ali chairs a cabinet meeting to discuss the economic situation.</p>
<p>LE TEMPS</p>
<p>- President Ben Ali on Wednesday received Sheikh Salah Kamel, chairman of Saudi finance group al-Baraka. Al-Baraka group invested in Tunis-based BEST bank.</p>
